  "body": "Brand New | 3 Standalone Freehold Homes | 4 Bedrooms | Premium Architectural Design\r\n\r\nDiscover an exclusive collection of three beautifully designed standalone homes, combining contemporary architecture, luxurious finishes and effortless modern living in sought-after Bucklands Beach.\r\n\r\nPerfect for first-home buyers, growing families or anyone seeking quality, style and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nThree Homes – Your Choice!\r\n\r\n Property - Floor Area - Land Area \r\n\r\n53A Gills Road - 158m² - 211m² \r\n53B Gills Road - 149m² - 187m² \r\n53C Gills Road - 149m² - 210m² \r\n\r\n Premium Features You'll Love\r\n• 4 spacious bedrooms in each home, plus a dedicated study in 53A.\r\n•  2 stylish bathrooms, including master ensuite, plus separate WC.\r\n• Designer kitchens featuring 60mm engineered stone benchtops and full-height cabinetry.\r\n• Premium Spanish tiles to ceiling height in bathrooms and WC/laundry.\r\n• Impressive 2.7m-high ceilings enhancing spacious open-plan living.\r\n• Outdoor entertaining decks for seamless indoor-outdoor living.\r\n• Freehold, low-maintenance sections with single internal-access garages.\r\n• 10 Year Master Build Guarantee for peace of mind.\r\n\r\nPrime Location & School Zones\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of Bucklands Beach, close to Half Moon Bay Marina, beautiful beaches, Howick Village and shopping amenities.\r\n\r\nNearby schools include Macleans Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College. \r\n\r\nDesigned to Stand Out. Built to Love.\r\n\r\nThree exceptional homes, premium craftsmanship and one fantastic location.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home or upgrading your lifestyle, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing!",
